From: dsh <dsh@local>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 00:38:21 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?fix(network):=20=E6=94=BE=E8=A1=8C=20dsh=20/=20?=
 =?UTF-8?q?hermes=20=E5=88=B0=E9=9B=86=E7=BE=A4=E5=86=85=20ingress-nginx?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20=E7=9A=84=20443?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

背景：集群内新增了 auth.panghuer.top 的 Ingress（ingress-nginx 终结 TLS，证书由
cert-manager 经 Cloudflare DNS-01 签发），CoreDNS 也把该域名分流到集群内的
ingress-nginx，使 oauth2-proxy 的内部鉴权不再出集群绕公网 VPS 与 frp 隧道
（实测 3336 ms -> 13~19 ms）。

但 dsh 与 hermes 是 default-deny 命名空间，egress 白名单里此前只有 ipBlock 0.0.0.0/0:443
（走公网 VPS 用的），没有同时覆盖集群内的 ClusterIP，于是分流后内部鉴权会连接超时。

改动：
  dsh/k8s/networkpolicies.yaml  web-egress      增加 to=ingress-nginx 的 443/80
  hermes/k8s/core.yaml          research-egress 增加 to=ingress-nginx 的 443/80

用 namespaceSelector kubernetes.io/metadata.name=ingress-nginx 而不是 IP，
这样 ingress-nginx 的 Service 重建、ClusterIP 变化都不受影响。
---
 dsh/k8s/networkpolicies.yaml | 9 +++++++++
 hermes/k8s/core.yaml         | 9 +++++++++
 2 files changed, 18 insertions(+)

diff --git a/dsh/k8s/networkpolicies.yaml b/dsh/k8s/networkpolicies.yaml
index 01e7272..a6a89ac 100644
--- a/dsh/k8s/networkpolicies.yaml
+++ b/dsh/k8s/networkpolicies.yaml
@@ -66,6 +66,15 @@ spec:
   policyTypes:
   - Egress
   egress:
+  - to:
+    - namespaceSelector:
+        matchLabels:
+          kubernetes.io/metadata.name: ingress-nginx
+    ports:
+    - protocol: TCP
+      port: 443
+    - protocol: TCP
+      port: 80
   - to:
     - namespaceSelector:
         matchLabels:
diff --git a/hermes/k8s/core.yaml b/hermes/k8s/core.yaml
index 19e7740..0c997d6 100644
--- a/hermes/k8s/core.yaml
+++ b/hermes/k8s/core.yaml
@@ -251,6 +251,15 @@ spec:
   policyTypes:
   - Egress
   egress:
+  - to:
+    - namespaceSelector:
+        matchLabels:
+          kubernetes.io/metadata.name: ingress-nginx
+    ports:
+    - protocol: TCP
+      port: 443
+    - protocol: TCP
+      port: 80
   - to:
     - namespaceSelector:
         matchLabels:
-- 
